WEBVTT

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.990
You've got some nerve.

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.990
Erika

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:10.660
It can't get any worse than this.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.540
Kizunairo kokoro to kokoro

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.540
The color of bonds binding hearts to hearts

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:17.750
Yakusoku no basho kitto michibiku wa

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:17.750
Will surely lead us to the Promised Land.

00:00:18.090 --> 00:00:22.010
Tsutaetai tsutaekirenai

00:00:18.090 --> 00:00:22.010
I want to tell you, but I can't.

00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:26.010
Hatenai omoi ha anata...

00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:26.010
I always long for you...

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:36.440
Boukansha no hibi ni yuuki wo dashitara sayonara

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:36.440
Say goodbye to the days of just being a bystander.

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:45.490
Demo "jiyuu" no teigi ni buranko no you ni yureteru no ne?

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:45.490
But am I swaying over the meaning of "Freedom", like a swing?

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:50.620
Gosenfu ni kaita kaidan

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:50.620
Stairs drawn on a music score,

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:54.120
Ippo susunde niho sagattemo

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:54.120
Even if I go down one step and back two steps,

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:58.130
Honno chotto setsunasa utau

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:58.130
The notes play a sad melody.

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:01.170
Watashi no real kanjite ne

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:01.170
Hear my reality!

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:05.090
Kizunairo kokoro to kokoro

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:05.090
The color of bonds binding hearts to hearts

00:01:05.090 --> 00:01:08.640
Yakusoku no basho kitto michibikuwa

00:01:05.090 --> 00:01:08.640
Will surely lead us to the Promised Land.

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:12.600
Tsutaetai tsutaekirenai

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:12.600
I want to tell you, but can't

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:16.020
Zutto anata wo sagashiteta

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:16.020
I've always been searching for you.

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:20.110
Tatoeba sou anataga hikari

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:20.110
Let's say you are the light

00:01:20.110 --> 00:01:23.570
Watashi ga kagede mitsume aetanara

00:01:20.110 --> 00:01:23.570
And I'm the shadow, gazing at one other.

00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:27.610
Namida iro no diamond

00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:27.610
The tear-colored diamond

00:01:27.610 --> 00:01:31.410
Nee zero kara kagayakasetai

00:01:27.610 --> 00:01:31.410
I want to make it shine from nothing.

00:01:31.410 --> 00:01:36.960
Kowagaranaide musunde ne ai wo

00:01:31.410 --> 00:01:36.960
Don't be afraid of falling in love.

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:39.130
Deaiwo...

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:39.130
Nor of meeting people...

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:45.450
Opening Ceremony

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:51.350
What? You stood her up?

00:01:51.350 --> 00:01:55.500
No! I showed up late, and the Vice Prez had left already!

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:57.750
So you stood her up.

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:00.590
I've added that to my reasons to apologize to her...

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:07.550
Hey. Seats aren't assigned by class?

00:02:07.550 --> 00:02:09.160
Oh. You'll figure it out soon enough.

00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:31.350
Honestly, I'm in agony.

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:37.640
After this year, my school life here will come to an end.

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:41.860
I can only share time with you,
all my loves, for but another year.

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:47.160
That is why I want to make this year the best year!

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:49.450
I will not hold back any means to achieve that!

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:50.950
You should.

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:52.160
President!

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:53.960
You're great!

00:02:56.920 --> 00:03:02.790
This performance... It must be his style of playing a joke.

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:07.550
I'm not in this alone! Let us all make this the best year, all together!

00:03:07.550 --> 00:03:10.310
Everyone in the arena! Are you having fun?!

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:15.660
Guys in the back! I need your help!

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:21.420
Second floor! We're one body, one soul!

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:24.070
We will save this world with all of our strength!

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:28.710
That's it.

00:03:28.710 --> 00:03:29.160
Ciao.

00:03:30.110 --> 00:03:31.150
Bravo!

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:32.380
President!

00:03:32.380 --> 00:03:34.650
He's so popular.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:38.860
Yup. Despite appearances,
he gets things done at critical moments.

00:03:43.170 --> 00:03:44.950
Wh-What is it now?

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:46.690
The star's here.

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:58.980
I'm sorry the President was a little excessive.

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:06.570
I know this is out of the blue, but do you see this hand?

00:04:07.240 --> 00:04:09.890
My hand is a little cold.

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:11.030
How about yours?

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:12.220
Hand?

00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:16.300
If you keep looking at it, doesn't it look a little lonely?

00:04:16.300 --> 00:04:21.540
If your hand looks lonely, then hold hands with me.

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:23.840
With someone else is fine, too.

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:26.140
Hold hands with someone close to you.

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:28.550
Then I'm sure it'll be warm, and you won't feel lonely.

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:37.610
But, no matter how lonely you are,
there are things you should and shouldn't do.

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:46.460
One should never burst into a girls' bath stark naked.

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:49.360
No! That was...

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:50.360
He's awful.

00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:51.900
Unbelievable.

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:52.910
Yeah.

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:57.830
Do you think Sendo-san is still mad?

00:05:01.090 --> 00:05:02.350
That's all.

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:02.820
Hasekura Kouhei

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:11.210
I think everyone knows him already,
but this is Hasekura Kouhei-kun, a transfer student.

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:13.640
Hello, all.

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:15.600
Question!

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:18.600
What was it like to burst into the girls' bath?

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:21.310
Tell us all, and I'll forgive your sin.

00:05:22.410 --> 00:05:24.130
What sin?! I didn't do anything!

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:26.940
Oh no...

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:28.570
Hey.

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:41.000
Kuze... Late, again, and on the very first day?

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:41.990
I'm sorry.

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:44.070
That's the Freeze Dry we know.

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:48.010
Hasekura. Your seat's back there.

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:51.960
Okay.

00:05:55.640 --> 00:05:57.270
I'm Hasekura Kouhei.

00:05:57.270 --> 00:05:58.300
Nice to meet you.

00:05:58.300 --> 00:05:59.600
Kuze Kiriha.

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:06.020
I'm starting homeroom.

00:06:06.020 --> 00:06:11.490
I'm sure you're all aware of this, but fifth year is when you must start making decisions regarding your individual futures.

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:15.490
Form a clear goal for your future and...

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:21.300
Hey there, King of the Girls' Bath.

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:23.370
You've become a famous figure now.

00:06:23.370 --> 00:06:26.250
Just think of it as her having introduced you to everyone already.

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:28.130
You're lucky it wasn't you.

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:33.260
Anyway, I've got to meet the Vice Prez and talk to her.

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:37.180
Okay.

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:39.180
Hey, Erika.

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:45.690
Okay.

00:06:46.190 --> 00:06:47.590
If it's here...

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:59.700
Oh, so you couldn't meet with her.

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:03.810
Yeah. It's hard to go talk to her with others around.

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:04.990
What should I do?

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:10.270
You'll be fine. You live on the same campus.

00:07:10.270 --> 00:07:12.820
There's going to be plenty of opportunities to apologize to her.

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:16.200
I sure hope so.

00:07:17.960 --> 00:07:20.310
Are you taking care of them, Haruna?

00:07:20.310 --> 00:07:22.800
Yup, since I'm in charge of keeping the school grounds clean.

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:25.080
They're beautiful.

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:28.350
In just a little longer, the rhododendron will bloom, as well.

00:07:28.350 --> 00:07:30.320
The entire flower bed will...

00:07:30.990 --> 00:07:31.910
Ah!

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:34.630
Kouhei-kun, look.

00:07:34.630 --> 00:07:36.350
Sorry, I've got to go!

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:37.320
Good luck!

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:43.130
Ow...

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:45.000
What's this?

00:07:45.430 --> 00:07:46.750
A student handbook?

00:07:53.510 --> 00:07:56.820
I-I'm sorry! I was in a bit of a hurry.

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:13.780
This is an incredible amount.

00:08:14.650 --> 00:08:17.120
Where are you taking these to? I'll help.

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:20.220
That's not a load a girl should carry alone.

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:21.280
No, thank you.

00:08:24.950 --> 00:08:26.870
You're pretty considerate.

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:28.750
It's only natural.

00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:38.420
I couldn't apologize to her in the end.

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:40.510
Kouhei-kun!

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:42.200
How did it go?

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:44.610
I see...

00:08:44.610 --> 00:08:48.520
Okay, everyone! Quiet down!

00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:52.020
Next is the hottest item of the day!

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:55.820
What is Kanade-san doing?

00:08:55.820 --> 00:08:58.740
Auctioning off things last year's graduates left behind.

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:01.030
The hottest item is...

00:09:01.820 --> 00:09:03.490
This boy!

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:06.620
Starting price is 5,000 yen!

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:08.180
5,000 yen?

00:09:08.180 --> 00:09:09.490
Is anyone going to buy that?

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:17.910
Guess what. This was held in her sleep by a Miss Shuchikan runner-up, who graduated several years ago.

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:18.780
I think.

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:20.380
It's a marvelous item!

00:09:22.770 --> 00:09:27.050
The pleasant sleep has been proven by Miss Shuchikan runner-up!

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:31.680
I hope you will have healing moments, as well, with this boy in your arms.

00:09:32.120 --> 00:09:33.280
6,000 yen!

00:09:33.280 --> 00:09:34.280
7,000 yen!

00:09:34.280 --> 00:09:35.690
8,367 yen!

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:36.970
Let's stop there!

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:39.700
8,367 yen it is!

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:40.280
Yes!

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:43.320
K-Kanade-san's good.

00:09:43.320 --> 00:09:46.240
The proceeds are used to buy equipment for the dorm.

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:50.750
It's an important role the RA has been filling for generations.

00:09:51.240 --> 00:09:52.510
Really?

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:54.620
Next up...

00:09:54.620 --> 00:09:56.500
Rejoice, boys.

00:09:56.500 --> 00:09:59.040
It's a secret magazine!

00:10:02.550 --> 00:10:05.890
Everyone. What time do you think it is?

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:09.090
So that's the Sister's famous frying pan.

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:12.630
Yuki-san. Please explain.

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:14.270
Aren't you the RA?

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:17.800
Sorry. I got a little carried away.

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:19.440
Forgive us, Maru-chan.

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:21.980
Stop calling me that!

00:10:21.980 --> 00:10:23.160
Maru-chan?

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:25.800
Sister's baptismal name is Margarita.

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:27.920
Ah, so that's why it becomes Maru-chan.

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:33.460
Okay. It's getting late now, so that's it for today.

00:10:33.460 --> 00:10:34.960
Bye bye.

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:36.850
Let's go, Kouhei-kun.

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:38.960
Y-Yeah.

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:40.210
Bye, RA.

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:41.840
Good night, Sister.

00:10:41.840 --> 00:10:42.970
Hey...

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:51.950
I think I'm unpacked now.

00:10:58.160 --> 00:10:59.630
What is this?

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:01.440
Hey there, Kouhei.

00:11:05.590 --> 00:11:07.540
Wh-What are you doing?

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:09.080
Come on, don't you remember?

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:12.950
We said we'd have a tea party at your place.

00:11:12.950 --> 00:11:14.870
Thanks for the invitation!

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:18.670
Wow! Looks like a boy's room.

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:23.650
Kanade-san. If you're going to visit me, please come through the front door.

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:22.150
So it's like this inside.

00:11:24.270 --> 00:11:26.550
What a tyrant.

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:29.490
I should be the one saying that.

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:32.990
Pardon me. I'm coming in.

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:35.100
Forcing her way in as she apologizes?

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:37.060
I bet she doesn't have any sense of guilt.

00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:41.360
Don't bully Hina-chan!

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:42.780
I'm not!

00:11:46.650 --> 00:11:49.660
Hina-chan's tea's the best.

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:50.870
Another cup please.

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:51.690
Okay.

00:11:52.470 --> 00:11:57.080
So, did you get the 108 pictures of Shuchikan Academy's secrets?

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:59.510
Yes, I completed the set.

00:11:59.510 --> 00:12:01.030
Give me the data then.

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:02.090
Okay.

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:04.210
I think I put it here.

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:03.200
Yuuki Haruna

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:03.360
To Hasekura Kouhei-sama

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:14.600
Here you go.

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:19.260
Whee! Now I can make the pamphlet for the new students!

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:22.020
Pictures are in my hand and cats go meow, meow!

00:12:23.140 --> 00:12:24.770
Pamphlet?

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:26.900
Is that why you made me go around and take the pictures?

00:12:26.900 --> 00:12:28.530
That's right.

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:30.660
Thank you so much, Kouhei.

00:12:31.490 --> 00:12:32.690
Gosh...

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:36.060
You don't have much stuff here, do you?

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:40.700
Yeah. I used to move around a lot,
so I keep things to a bare minimum.

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:46.080
We need to gather things like a tea server,
coffee miller, and utensils for tea parties.

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:47.400
I don't need them.

00:12:47.400 --> 00:12:49.350
It's a problem without them.

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:51.050
Do we have to bring them down every time?

00:12:52.890 --> 00:12:56.930
You're not planning to make this place
the regular spot for the tea parties, are you?

00:12:56.930 --> 00:12:58.410
Bingo!

00:12:58.410 --> 00:12:59.700
You got it.

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:00.930
Come on now...

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:03.320
Here. The Darjeeling tea's ready.

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:07.320
It smells great.

00:13:07.320 --> 00:13:10.700
Really? It's wonderful you like it.

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:12.940
It's all thanks to your skills.

00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:14.830
You go, my bride.

00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:16.410
"Bride"?

00:13:16.410 --> 00:13:18.300
Hina-chan, cookies, too, please.

00:13:18.300 --> 00:13:19.580
Coming right out.

00:13:20.310 --> 00:13:21.500
It's so good.

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:22.790
Yup.

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:23.710
Try this, too.

00:13:23.710 --> 00:13:24.270
Yup.

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:39.480
Yukimaru. Breakfast.

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:41.550
I brought you lots of fresh vegetables.

00:13:42.470 --> 00:13:44.130
Yukimaru?

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:52.150
Do you see your name?

00:13:52.150 --> 00:13:53.200
There, I found it.

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:54.040
What is this?

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:57.920
The yearly posting of results from the mock exam.

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:00.560
You're not interested in the results?

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:02.270
I don't recall taking one.

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:04.930
Basically, he doesn't want to talk about it.

00:14:05.390 --> 00:14:07.570
Good morning, Kouhei-kun.

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:09.380
Morning.

00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:11.070
Where are you, Haruna?

00:14:11.070 --> 00:14:12.750
I'm right in the middle.

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:15.730
You're being modest. You're pretty high up there.

00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:19.140
I can't even compare to Sendo-san though.

00:14:19.140 --> 00:14:20.280
The VP?

00:14:20.280 --> 00:14:21.840
Yup. See?

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:26.340
Sendo-san is almost always in the lead in both subjects and overall.

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:28.840
Wow, that's something.

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:30.340
I lost again...

00:14:35.650 --> 00:14:38.020
So she couldn't win again.

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:40.650
Math.

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:44.950
Solely in math, Kuze-san always takes first place.

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:53.500
Therefore in this case, you can solve for the answer using the half-angle equation from trigonometry.

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:56.770
She passes in other courses right at the borderline,

00:14:56.770 --> 00:15:01.310
but I feel Kuze-san does it on purpose.

00:15:03.680 --> 00:15:04.510
That's...

00:15:06.350 --> 00:15:08.840
What? Yukimaru ran away again?

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:13.680
Yes. I went to feed him breakfast,
and there was a hole in the ground.

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:16.300
Then that rabbit was...

00:15:16.300 --> 00:15:17.760
You saw him?!

00:15:17.760 --> 00:15:20.300
Yeah. I saw him from the window during class.

00:15:20.300 --> 00:15:22.990
Really? Where was he?

00:15:22.990 --> 00:15:24.060
You.

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:29.280
What are you doing to my sister?

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:37.740
You made her cry?

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:40.200
No! I was just...

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:42.100
Nii-sama, you have it wrong.

00:15:42.100 --> 00:15:46.130
Yukimaru ran away, and Hasekura-senpai saw him.

00:15:46.970 --> 00:15:47.960
Yukimaru?

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:50.360
In any case, I'll go look for him.

00:15:50.360 --> 00:15:52.780
Togi-senpai. We'll talk later.

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:54.220
Hasekura-senpai.

00:15:56.930 --> 00:15:59.250
What? Yukimaru?

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:01.590
No, I haven't seen him.

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:05.970
You got it! I'll be the one to capture him!

00:16:06.680 --> 00:16:11.500
Really? Hasekura-kun running around for Shiro-chan?

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:13.450
What are you looking at?

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:16.840
I'm sorry, but could you help Shiro?

00:16:17.430 --> 00:16:18.540
Please!

00:16:19.860 --> 00:16:21.110
Okay.

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:24.040
A bunny?

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:27.130
You should have finished it off.

00:16:28.570 --> 00:16:31.300
Just so you know, we're not out on a hunt.

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:32.630
I was only joking.

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:34.780
It didn't sound like it.

00:16:34.780 --> 00:16:36.120
And it wasn't funny, either.

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:44.630
Are you running around,
searching for that fourth grader's sake?

00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:46.130
Yeah.

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:47.840
You're such an idiot.

00:16:49.460 --> 00:16:53.400
Nothing good ever comes from involving yourself with others.

00:16:57.940 --> 00:17:00.540
I feel that's a waste.

00:17:02.310 --> 00:17:04.290
Never mind.

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:04.940
Bye.

00:17:09.990 --> 00:17:11.340
Yukimaru!

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:13.840
Be a good boy and come out!

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:16.050
Yukimaru!

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:19.680
Yukimaru! Where are you?

00:17:23.740 --> 00:17:24.800
He's nowhere to be found.

00:17:24.800 --> 00:17:26.480
Where is he hiding?

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:28.940
Vice Prez.

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:47.810
Get out of there!

00:17:47.810 --> 00:17:49.270
Yukimaru!

00:17:49.270 --> 00:17:50.060
Watch out!

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:52.710
I won't make it in time...

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:07.520
That was a close call.

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:10.150
Hey! Are you all right?

00:18:12.060 --> 00:18:14.650
Yeah. We're fine.

00:18:14.650 --> 00:18:17.610
You're making Shiro-chan worry.

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:19.160
Don't run away again, you hear?

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:21.660
Why you little...

00:18:22.430 --> 00:18:23.900
You're reckless.

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:26.450
I lost track of myself.

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:27.240
Here.

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:30.100
Stand up.

00:18:32.620 --> 00:18:33.340
Thank you.

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:41.140
Again?

00:18:41.610 --> 00:18:44.950
No, I didn't mean that. This is...

00:18:45.630 --> 00:18:47.890
It's no surprise that Erika would be startled like that.

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:49.670
Prez.

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:52.400
Hasekura-kun. Look at your right hand.

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:53.320
Hand?

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:58.150
You can't leave it like that.

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:09.650
Oh. How boring.

00:19:09.650 --> 00:19:11.440
But that's fine.

00:19:14.890 --> 00:19:16.130
I'm sorry.

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:18.500
Don't be.

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:21.560
You're closer than you have to be.

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:24.260
Yukimaru!

00:19:26.710 --> 00:19:28.020
Yukimaru!

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:30.500
I'm glad you're fine.

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:32.160
Shiro.

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:36.450
Isn't there something you should say first?

00:19:36.450 --> 00:19:37.850
Hasekura-senpai!

00:19:37.850 --> 00:19:39.030
Thank you very much!

00:19:39.500 --> 00:19:41.600
You're welcome.

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:43.430
You found Yukimaru.

00:19:43.430 --> 00:19:44.410
Thank goodness.

00:19:45.170 --> 00:19:48.180
Yes. Thank you very much, everybody.

00:19:57.890 --> 00:20:00.960
I couldn't apologize to her again.

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:05.430
It was a perfect chance, too.

00:20:06.110 --> 00:20:09.620
I really have bad luck.

00:20:09.620 --> 00:20:10.740
Are you sure?

00:20:10.740 --> 00:20:14.040
You had great timing when you saved Yukimaru.

00:20:18.640 --> 00:20:21.180
You're overreacting.

00:20:23.190 --> 00:20:23.780
Um...

00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:26.360
Thank you very much!

00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:26.360
I'm very sorry!

00:20:27.440 --> 00:20:28.490
Why are you apologizing?

00:20:32.270 --> 00:20:35.640
Regarding the bath, and how I stood you up for the meeting.

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:37.380
I wanted to apologize for both.

00:20:38.060 --> 00:20:42.530
Regarding the meeting, sure,
but the bath was my brother's doing.

00:20:42.530 --> 00:20:46.640
Regardless of the cause, I did see you, so I should apologize.

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:49.390
Oh, so you did see.

00:20:50.650 --> 00:20:52.750
Um. So...

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:54.350
I'm really sor-

00:20:58.300 --> 00:21:01.230
I went too far at the opening ceremony.

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:02.650
So, here.

00:21:03.830 --> 00:21:08.400
To call it even between us, and to complete
the welcoming handshake I couldn't do on the first day.

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:11.040
Vice Prez.

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:16.090
Once again, I welcome you, Hasekura Kouhei-kun.

00:21:16.090 --> 00:21:18.290
Welcome to Shuchikan Academy.

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:22.170
Yeah. I hope we get...

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:26.860
I hope we get along.

00:21:46.650 --> 00:21:48.300
The results are in.

00:21:51.530 --> 00:21:55.320
So, he's not the average boy we see.

00:21:59.320 --> 00:22:01.650
No wonder he makes Erika go crazy.

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:11.510
I miss you

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:11.510
I miss you.

00:22:22.020 --> 00:22:31.660
Mabushii kurai e ni kaita jikan nano

00:22:22.020 --> 00:22:31.660
Just like in a perfect painting,

00:22:31.660 --> 00:22:36.410
Sou ima ha...

00:22:31.660 --> 00:22:36.410
Now is a dazzling moment.

00:22:40.710 --> 00:22:50.470
Kawari hajimeta machinami ni me wo sorashi

00:22:40.710 --> 00:22:50.470
I look away from the city that's starting to change

00:22:50.470 --> 00:22:56.180
Omoide ha tada iuno

00:22:50.470 --> 00:22:56.180
And my memories whisper to me, saying,

00:22:56.180 --> 00:23:03.310
Soko de tomadou dake

00:22:56.180 --> 00:23:03.310
You're only at a loss.

00:23:03.310 --> 00:23:05.280
I miss you

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:09.570
Omoi wo sono mama dakishimete

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:09.570
Hold on to your feelings.

00:23:09.570 --> 00:23:11.490
I miss you

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:15.790
Kawaranu omoi wo shiritai no

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:15.790
I want to know how you've always felt.

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:17.700
I miss you

00:23:17.700 --> 00:23:21.460
Negatteru kara

00:23:17.700 --> 00:23:21.460
I'll always long for you, so...

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:27.460
I miss you...

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:39.930
Y-You know, I have something I want to ask you.

00:23:39.930 --> 00:23:41.060
What is it?

00:23:44.250 --> 00:23:49.820
Um... Do you ever fall in love at first sight?

00:23:49.820 --> 00:23:51.320
No.

00:23:53.500 --> 00:23:54.820
I should have known.

00:23:54.820 --> 00:23:57.050
What is this?

00:23:58.490 --> 00:24:01.710
I bet it's my brother again, isn't it?!

00:24:05.080 --> 00:24:20.100
「Millennium Fountain」

00:24:05.420 --> 00:24:20.100
Third Episode

00:24:05.910 --> 00:24:08.080
Life is a game.

00:24:08.920 --> 00:24:11.400
I keep going back to square one.

00:24:12.630 --> 00:24:18.240
When I spun the roulette wheel full force, it broke, and I overshot the goal.
